%%{init: {'theme':'dark','themeVariables':{'fontFamily':'system-ui,sans-serif','clusterBkg':'#0f172a','clusterBorder':'#334155','lineColor':'#94a3b8','primaryTextColor':'#f1f5f9','edgeLabelBackground':'#1e293b','titleColor':'#f8fafc'}}}%%
flowchart TD
  A[Pawn on 8th / 1st rank] --> B[game_execute_move detects MOVE_TYPE_PROMOTION]

  B --> C{Immediate choice from UART API before execution?}
  C -->|yes| D[Inline promotion_piece in extended_move · finishes in one pass]
  C -->|no| E[promotion_mutex: promotion_state.pending = true · row/col · player]

  E --> F[LED PROMOTE animation · game_check_promotion_needed — green promo buttons]
  E --> G[Player stays on move until choice]

  G --> H{Input}
  H --> I[UART/web: game_process_promotion_command]
  H --> J[Buttons: game_process_promotion_button via queue]

  I --> K[game_execute_promotion — game_piece_for_promotion_choice]
  J --> K

  K --> L[Write queen/rook/bishop/knight · pending = false · GAME_STATE_ACTIVE]
  L --> M[Switch player · timers · clear piece_lifted · end-of-game check]

  D --> FIN([end of move])
  M --> FIN
